<title>POLAND: Mostostal-Z Q1 net rises to PLN 2.2 mln.</title>
<headline>Mostostal-Z Q1 net rises to PLN 2.2 mln.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-05-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mostostal-Zabrze preliminary results for the first quarter of the year ending March 31, 1997.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>						Q1 1997	Q1 1996</p>
<p>    operating profit			 2.95 vs	2.60</p>
<p>    pre-tax profit			   3.38 vs	2.16</p>
<p>    net profit				 2.23 vs	1.72</p>
<p>NOTE - full company name is: Mostostal Zabrze SA.</p>
<p>    net sales				 35.87 vs     49.92</p>
<p>    costs of sales			  29.56 vs     36.80</p>
<p>    extraordinary profit		   0.00 vs	0.01</p>
<p>    income tax				 1.15 vs	0.45</p>
<p>    other taxes				0.00 vs	0.00</p>
<p>    financial revenues		     1.22 vs	7.09</p>
<p>    financial costs			  0.79 vs	7.54</p>
<p>    investment				 2.60 vs	1.15</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
